{"id":"n5_u09_l1","unit_id":"n5_u09","instructional_level":"N5","title":"い-adjectives I","goal":"Describe things: expensive, cheap, heavy, light, long, short, cold, hot.","introduces":{"vocab":["v_takai","v_yasui","v_hikui","v_nagai","v_mijikai","v_omoi","v_karui","v_atsui","v_samui","v_tsumetai","v_hiroi","v_semai"]},"explain":[{"heading":"Adjectives ending in い","body":["い-adjectives end in い: たかい (expensive, tall), やすい (cheap), おもい (heavy), かるい (light), ながい (long), みじかい (short). Learn them in opposite pairs.","さむい is cold weather, つめたい is cold to the touch, あつい is hot."],"examples":[{"ja":"この とけい は たかい です","reading":"kono tokei wa takai desu","en":"This watch is expensive."},{"ja":"つめたい みず","reading":"tsumetai mizu","en":"cold water"}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u09_av01","q_n5u09_av02","q_n5u09_av03","q_n5u09_av04","q_n5u09_av05","q_n5u09_av06","q_n5u09_av07","q_n5u09_av08","q_n5u09_av09","q_n5u09_av10","q_n5u09_ty01","q_n5u09_ty02","q_n5u09_ty03","q_n5u09_ty04","q_n5u09_gl01","q_n5u09_gl02","q_n5u09_gl03","q_n5u09_gl04","q_n5u09_tr01","q_n5u09_tr02","q_n5u09_vm_takai","q_n5u09_vm_yasui","q_n5u09_vm_hikui","q_n5u09_vm_nagai","q_n5u09_vm_mijikai","q_n5u09_vm_omoi","q_n5u09_vm_karui","q_n5u09_vm_atsui","q_n5u09_vm_samui","q_n5u09_vm_tsumetai","q_n5u09_vm_hiroi","q_n5u09_vm_semai"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u09_av01","q_n5u09_av03","q_n5u09_av05","q_n5u09_av07","q_n5u09_av08","q_n5u09_ty01","q_n5u09_gl01"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n5_u09_l2","unit_id":"n5_u09","instructional_level":"N5","title":"い-adjectives II","goal":"Add adjectives about speed, difficulty, feelings and colours.","introduces":{"vocab":["v_hayai","v_osoi","v_muzukashii","v_yasashii","v_omoshiroi","v_tanoshii","v_isogashii","v_shiroi","v_kuroi","v_ii","v_warui"]},"explain":[{"heading":"More い-adjectives","body":["はやい (fast, early), おそい (slow, late), むずかしい (difficult), やさしい (easy, kind), おもしろい (interesting), たのしい (fun), いそがしい (busy), しろい (white), くろい (black), いい (good), わるい (bad)."],"examples":[{"ja":"にほんご は むずかしい です","reading":"nihongo wa muzukashii desu","en":"Japanese is difficult."}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u09_av11","q_n5u09_av12","q_n5u09_av13","q_n5u09_av14","q_n5u09_av15","q_n5u09_av16","q_n5u09_amt01","q_n5u09_ty05","q_n5u09_ty06","q_n5u09_tr03","q_n5u09_tr04","q_n5u09_tr05","q_n5u09_dc01","q_n5u09_dc02","q_n5u09_vm_hayai","q_n5u09_vm_osoi","q_n5u09_vm_muzukashii","q_n5u09_vm_yasashii","q_n5u09_vm_omoshiroi","q_n5u09_vm_tanoshii","q_n5u09_vm_isogashii","q_n5u09_vm_shiroi","q_n5u09_vm_kuroi","q_n5u09_vm_ii","q_n5u09_vm_warui"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u09_av11","q_n5u09_av13","q_n5u09_av14","q_n5u09_av15","q_n5u09_ty05","q_n5u09_tr04","q_n5u09_dc01"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n5_u09_l3","unit_id":"n5_u09","instructional_level":"N5","title":"な-adjectives","goal":"Learn adjectives that take な before a noun.","introduces":{"vocab":["v_kirei","v_shizuka","v_nigiyaka","v_genki","v_suki","v_kirai","v_jouzu","v_heta","v_taihen","v_benri","v_hima"],"grammar":["g_na_adjective"]},"explain":[{"heading":"Adjectives with な","body":["きれい (pretty, clean), しずか (quiet), にぎやか (lively), げんき (cheerful), べんり (convenient), ひま (free), たいへん (tough), すき (liked), きらい (disliked), じょうず (good at), へた (bad at).","Before a noun add な: きれい な まち. Negative: しずか じゃ ありません."],"examples":[{"ja":"しずか な こうえん です","reading":"shizuka na kouen desu","en":"It is a quiet park."}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u09_amt02","q_n5u09_gn01","q_n5u09_gn02","q_n5u09_gn03","q_n5u09_gn04","q_n5u09_gn05","q_n5u09_ty07","q_n5u09_ty08","q_n5u09_tr06","q_n5u09_tr07","q_n5u09_tr08","q_n5u09_tr09","q_n5u09_tr10","q_n5u09_dc03","q_n5u09_vm_kirei","q_n5u09_vm_shizuka","q_n5u09_vm_nigiyaka","q_n5u09_vm_genki","q_n5u09_vm_suki","q_n5u09_vm_kirai","q_n5u09_vm_jouzu","q_n5u09_vm_heta","q_n5u09_vm_taihen","q_n5u09_vm_benri","q_n5u09_vm_hima"]},"context":{"question_ids":["q_n5u09_gn06","q_n5u09_gn07"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u09_amt02","q_n5u09_gn01","q_n5u09_gn02","q_n5u09_gn03","q_n5u09_gn05","q_n5u09_tr06","q_n5u09_ty07"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n5_u09_l4","unit_id":"n5_u09","instructional_level":"N5","title":"Very, not very, a little","goal":"Say how much: とても, あまり, すこし, ぜんぜん.","introduces":{"vocab":["v_totemo","v_amari","v_sukoshi","v_zenzen","v_dou","v_donna"],"grammar":["g_degree_words"]},"explain":[{"heading":"Degree words","body":["とても (very) and すこし (a little) go with positive adjectives. あまり (not very) and ぜんぜん (not at all) go with negative adjectives. どう asks \"how?\" and どんな asks \"what kind of?\"."],"examples":[{"ja":"この とけい は あまり たかく ない です","reading":"kono tokei wa amari takakunai desu","en":"This watch is not very expensive."}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u09_gd01","q_n5u09_gd02","q_n5u09_gd03","q_n5u09_gd04","q_n5u09_gd05","q_n5u09_gd06","q_n5u09_ty09","q_n5u09_ty10","q_n5u09_tr11","q_n5u09_tr12","q_n5u09_dc04","q_n5u09_vm_totemo","q_n5u09_vm_amari","q_n5u09_vm_sukoshi","q_n5u09_vm_zenzen","q_n5u09_vm_dou","q_n5u09_vm_donna"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u09_gd01","q_n5u09_gd02","q_n5u09_gd03","q_n5u09_gd04","q_n5u09_gd05","q_n5u09_ty09","q_n5u09_tr11"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n5_u09_l5","unit_id":"n5_u09","instructional_level":"N5","title":"い-adjective forms and が","goal":"Make negatives, put adjectives before nouns and say \"but\".","introduces":{"grammar":["g_i_adjective","g_ga_but"]},"explain":[{"heading":"い-adjective negatives","body":["Drop い and add くない: たかい → たかくない です. Before a noun the adjective stays as it is: たかい とけい."],"examples":[{"ja":"この ラーメン は おいしく ない です","reading":"kono raamen wa oishikunai desu","en":"This ramen is not delicious."}]},{"heading":"が: but, and likes","body":["が between two clauses means \"but\". The thing you like or dislike takes が: ねこ が すき です."],"examples":[{"ja":"この ケーキ は おいしい です が たかい です","reading":"kono keeki wa oishii desu ga takai desu","en":"This cake is delicious, but expensive."}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u09_gi01","q_n5u09_gi02","q_n5u09_gi03","q_n5u09_gi04","q_n5u09_gi05","q_n5u09_gg01","q_n5u09_gg02","q_n5u09_gg03","q_n5u09_gg04","q_n5u09_gg05","q_n5u09_so01","q_n5u09_so02"]},"context":{"question_ids":["q_n5u09_gi06","q_n5u09_gi07","q_n5u09_gg06"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u09_gi01","q_n5u09_gi02","q_n5u09_gi03","q_n5u09_gi05","q_n5u09_gg01","q_n5u09_gg02","q_n5u09_gg03"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n5_u09_l6","unit_id":"n5_u09","instructional_level":"N5","title":"Kanji: 高 安 新 古 長 多 少 白 赤 青","goal":"Read ten kanji used in adjectives and colours.","introduces":{"kanji":["k_takai","k_yasu","k_shin","k_furu","k_naga","k_ooi","k_sukuna","k_shiro","k_aka","k_ao"]},"explain":[{"heading":"Adjective kanji","body":["Adjective kanji carry the stem; the い stays in kana: 高い (たかい), 安い, 新しい, 古い, 長い. 少し means \"a little\". Colours: 白い, 赤い, 青い."],"examples":[{"ja":"高い 山","reading":"takai yama","en":"a high mountain"},{"ja":"新しい 店","reading":"atarashii mise","en":"a new shop"}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u09_kd01","q_n5u09_kd02","q_n5u09_kd03","q_n5u09_kd04","q_n5u09_kd05","q_n5u09_kd06","q_n5u09_kd07","q_n5u09_kd08","q_n5u09_kd09","q_n5u09_kd10","q_n5u09_kk01","q_n5u09_kk02","q_n5u09_kk03","q_n5u09_kk04","q_n5u09_kk05","q_n5u09_kk06","q_n5u09_kk07","q_n5u09_kk08","q_n5u09_kk09","q_n5u09_kmt01","q_n5u09_kmt02","q_n5u09_kcf01","q_n5u09_kcf02","q_n5u09_kcf03"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u09_kd01","q_n5u09_kd03","q_n5u09_kd04","q_n5u09_kd08","q_n5u09_kk01","q_n5u09_kk03","q_n5u09_kmt01","q_n5u09_kcf01","q_n5u09_kcf03"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n5_u09_l7","unit_id":"n5_u09","instructional_level":"N5","title":"A busy shopping street","goal":"Describe shops and read shopping signs.","introduces":{"vocab":["v_biru","v_fuku","v_basho","v_ninki","v_seeru","v_koosaten"]},"explain":[{"heading":"Street words","body":["ビル (building), ふく (clothes), ばしょ (place), にんき (popular), セール (sale), こうさてん (crossing)."],"examples":[{"ja":"この みせ は にんき です","reading":"kono mise wa ninki desu","en":"This shop is popular."}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u09_dg01","q_n5u09_dg02","q_n5u09_dg03","q_n5u09_dg04","q_n5u09_dg05","q_n5u09_dg06","q_n5u09_vm_biru","q_n5u09_vm_fuku","q_n5u09_vm_basho","q_n5u09_vm_ninki","q_n5u09_vm_seeru","q_n5u09_vm_koosaten"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u09_dg01","q_n5u09_dg02","q_n5u09_dg04","q_n5u09_dg06"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n5_u09_l8","unit_id":"n5_u09","instructional_level":"N5","title":"Listen and read","goal":"Follow descriptions by ear and read shop signs.","introduces":{},"explain":[{"heading":"Descriptions","body":["Listen for the degree word first, then the adjective ending."],"examples":[{"ja":"とても たかい です","reading":"totemo takai desu","en":"It is very expensive."}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u09_gl05","q_n5u09_gl06","q_n5u09_gl07","q_n5u09_gl08"]},"context":{"question_ids":["q_n5u09_rq01","q_n5u09_rq02","q_n5u09_rq03","q_n5u09_rq04","q_n5u09_rq05","q_n5u09_rq06","q_n5u09_rq07","q_n5u09_rq08","q_n5u09_rq09","q_n5u09_rq10"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u09_gl05","q_n5u09_gl06","q_n5u09_gl07","q_n5u09_rq01","q_n5u09_rq05","q_n5u09_rq08"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n5_u09_l9","unit_id":"n5_u09","instructional_level":"N5","title":"Review: units 1 to 9","goal":"Mix words from the first nine units.","introduces":{},"explain":[{"heading":"Review","body":["Earlier words return to keep them fresh."],"examples":[{"ja":"きれい な まち です","reading":"kirei na machi desu","en":"It is a pretty town."}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u09_sr_ai","q_n5u09_sr_aka","q_n5u09_sr_ika","q_n5u09_sr_ookii","q_n5u09_sr_isu","q_n5u09_sr_shio","q_n5u09_sr_soko","q_n5u09_sr_kuchi","q_n5u09_sr_tokei","q_n5u09_sr_otoko","q_n5u09_sr_nani","q_n5u09_sr_sakana","q_n5u09_sr_hito","q_n5u09_sr_mise","q_n5u09_sr_hana","q_n5u09_sr_yoru","q_n5u09_sr_sensei","q_n5u09_sr_sora","q_n5u09_sr_yasai","q_n5u09_sr_furui"]},"context":{"question_ids":["q_n5u09_sr_kagi","q_n5u09_sr_mado","q_n5u09_sr_ringo","q_n5u09_sr_enpitsu","q_n5u09_sr_sanpo","q_n5u09_sr_ocha","q_n5u09_sr_konnyaku","q_n5u09_sr_jaa","q_n5u09_sr_nikki","q_n5u09_sr_ojiisan","q_n5u09_sr_ryouri","q_n5u09_sr_desu","q_n5u09_sr_nihonjin","q_n5u09_sr_onamae","q_n5u09_sr_aisu","q_n5u09_sr_tomato","q_n5u09_sr_miruku","q_n5u09_sr_resutoran","q_n5u09_sr_itaria","q_n5u09_sr_anime","q_n5u09_sr_juu","q_n5u09_sr_ima","q_n5u09_sr_han","q_n5u09_sr_kippu"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u09_sr_ai","q_n5u09_sr_aka","q_n5u09_sr_ika","q_n5u09_sr_ookii","q_n5u09_sr_isu","q_n5u09_sr_doa","q_n5u09_sr_basu","q_n5u09_sr_gorufu","q_n5u09_sr_karee"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"}
